      "author": {
        "id": null,
        "name": null
      },
      "text": "HEY...These guys can't \"walk on water\" BUT, they can certainly do whatever you and your vehicle needs! A while back, I turned a corner a bit too  fast while hauling a crock pot full of creamy potato soup to a church pot-luck...Crock pots are REALLY-TIPSY, so I had a gallon of milk/cream/soup all over the carpeted floor of our Toyota. 'Called the local dealer to see if they did detailing...they said \"NO, call BLUE ROSE\". When Blue Rose was told that we were \"crying about spilled milk\", they told us \"bring it in immediately...we can't let that stuff age and get really nasty and turn sour\". We did that! Within, just a few hours, they called us back, they were done! As we looked at the size of their multifaceted operation ,we could only be impressed that they must have quickly squeezed us into an , already swamped, schedule....We don't see a need for their quality services in the near future, but their business card has a prominant spot on our bulletin board. TRY 'EM...You'll be glad your did!",
